1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,400
Morning. You're early.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,900
The bus broke down, so I walked.
Twenty minutes in the rain.

3
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:09,000
<i>She never mentioned the umbrella
on her desk.</i>

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:11,200
- Coffee?
- Please.

5
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:14,600
[thunder rumbles]

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,300
{\an8}RIVERSIDE CLINIC — THIRD FLOOR

7
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:22,000
Look, if we file the report today,
nobody upstairs has to know.

8
